.TH XBOX-WIRELESS-GUI 1 "November 2026" "0.3.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
xbox-wireless-gui \- manage the Xbox Wireless Adapter and controllers on Linux
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B xbox-wireless-gui
.RI [ OPTION... ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
GTK4 + Libadwaita interface for the Microsoft Xbox Wireless Adapter on Linux,
with automatic detection of the
.B xone
(current) and
.B xow
(legacy) drivers.
.PP
It enables/disables pairing, lists controllers with UPower battery status,
adjusts the guide-button LED, powers controllers off, tests each rumble
motor, manages xone audio/headsets, pairs Bluetooth controllers and includes
a live button tester plus a copyable diagnostic report. The app also exposes
a session D-Bus API, a background notification service, battery history,
event-driven refresh and input-remapper integration.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print the application version.
.TP
.B \-\-status [\-\-json]
Print driver, dongle, pairing, controllers and battery status without opening
the GUI.
.TP
.B \-\-background
Run the background notification/LED-profile service without a window.
.TP
.B \-\-verbose
Enable verbose logging to stderr and the state log file.
.TP
.B \-\-diagnose
Print a Markdown diagnostic report (kernel, driver, firmware, udev, evdev,
UPower and audio).
.TP
.B \-\-pair on|off
Enable or disable wireless pairing (xone) or request xow pairing.
.TP
.B \-\-poweroff [0-15|-1]
Power off one wireless client or all clients.
.TP
.B \-\-led ID MODE BRIGHTNESS
Set the guide-button LED (xone).
.PP
Standard GTK/GApplication options, e.g.
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help .
.SH D-BUS
Session interface
.B com.github.xboxwirelessgui.Control1
at
.I /com/github/xboxwirelessgui/Control
provides GetStatus, Refresh, Present, SetPairing, SetLed and Poweroff.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.local/state/xbox-wireless-gui/app.log
rotating application log.
.TP
.I ~/.config/xbox-wireless-gui/profiles.json
per-controller names and saved LED profiles.
.TP
.I /sys/bus/usb/drivers/xone-dongle/*/pairing
pairing switch of the xone dongle (root or the xboxwireless group with the shipped udev rule)
.TP
.I /sys/class/leds/gip*
LED mode/brightness of xone controllers
.TP
.I /usr/share/xbox-wireless-gui/
application data (main.py, backend)
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR xone-get-firmware.sh (8),
.BR bluetoothctl (1)
